<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I Destroyed Disco</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Dare</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What's Wrong With New York?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5fSW8zHTMOgIvYQ7mk1Y1P</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.120" end="00:10.520">I break records, glasses, faces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.520" end="00:15.130">Kick the whole world in the teeth with my untied laces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.130" end="00:18.810">Face it, you'll never reach my level so don't chase it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.810" end="00:22.870">Save it, wait, does anyone know where the bass is?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.870" end="00:25.720">I put them all on suicide watch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.720" end="00:28.530">Nonstop, got 'em working overtime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.530" end="00:30.430">Check the clock, rock hard</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.430" end="00:33.180">Why stop? Don't know, I don't care</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.180" end="00:35.050">What's a blogger to a rocker?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.050" end="00:37.390">What's a rocker to the dare?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.390" end="00:40.840">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.840" end="00:43.990">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.990" end="00:48.170">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.170" end="00:52.080">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.080" end="00:53.980">Punk rock to disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.980" end="00:56.700">Missiles blowing up the...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.700" end="00:59.530">Clubs from New York to San Francisco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.530" end="01:03.170">It goes with me wherever I wanna</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.170" end="01:06.960">Blow my head off on the search for Nirvana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.960" end="01:10.360">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.360" end="01:18.360">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.420" end="02:13.340">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.340" end="02:16.720">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.720" end="02:19.870">Now let the disco destroy you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.870" end="02:21.370">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.870" end="02:21.370">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.870" end="02:21.370">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.280" end="02:21.780">I destroy disco</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.630" end="02:25.630" /></div></body></tt>